  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive)</p>\n<p><strong>Mods:</strong> All Ranged Weapons which can expend a Move Action to Reload (either as a Special Feature or due to the effect of an Attachment)</p>\n<p><em>Shift some rounds here, adjust a few screws there, and now it feeds quicker. The heavy springs do make it slower to load by hand, though.</em></p>\n<p>When sacrificing a Move Action to use the Reload Action without an Action on the weapon, doing so only requires sacrificing half of the user’s MOVE (which must be done before any of their MOVE has been expended in their Turn). However, reloading the weapon normally (i.e., without sacrificing any MOVE) now requires an additional Action.</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0 (Weapon Mod)</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Mod Catalog &gt; Weapon Mods).</em></p>"
